eviews 缓存失效]&#10;    B --&gt; D[ReviewCount 缓存失效]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;revalidateTag(&#39;product-123&#39;)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[ProductInfo 缓存失效]&#10;&#10;    G[不受影响的缓存] --&gt; H[其他产品的所有缓存]&#10;    G --&gt; I[全局导航缓存]&#10;    G --&gt; J[用户个人资料缓存]\">graph TD\n    A[submitReview 执行] --&gt; B[\"revalidateTag('reviews-123')\"]\n    B --&gt; C[ProductReviews 缓存失效]\n    B --&gt; D[ReviewCount 缓存失效]\n    A --&gt; E[\"revalidateTag('product-123')\"]\n    E --&gt; F[ProductInfo 缓存失效]\n\n    G[不受影响的缓存] --&gt; H[其他产品的所有缓存]\n    G --&gt; I[全局导航缓存]\n    G --&gt; J[用户个人资料缓存]</pre><h2 id=\"stale-while-revalidate-模式\">Stale-While-Revalidate 模式</h2><p>SWR（Stale-While-Revalidate）是 SSR 缓存中最实用的模式——用户永远不会看到加载状态，但数据最终会更新：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>缓存未过期</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>缓存过期但在 SWR 窗口内（返回旧值，后台更新）</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>缓存过期且超出 SWR 窗口</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{response} = \\begin{cases} T_{cache\\_read} &amp; \\text{缓存未过期} \\\\ T_{cache\\_read} &amp; \\text{缓存过期但在 SWR 窗口内（返回旧值，后台更新）} \\\\ T_{compute} &amp; \\text{缓存过期且超出 SWR 窗口} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\