n><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缓存未过期</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缓存过期但在</span><span class=\"mord\"> SWR </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口内（返回旧值，后台更新）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缓存过期且超出</span><span class=\"mord\"> SWR </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ISR (Incremental Static Regeneration) — Next.js 的 SWR 实现&#10;// app/products/page.tsx&#10;export const revalidate = 60; // 60 秒后标记为 stale&#10;&#10;export default async function ProductsPage() {&#10;  const products = await getProducts();&#10;  return &lt;ProductGrid products={products} /&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 行为：&#10;// 0-60s: 返回缓存的静态页面&#10;// 60s+: 返回缓存的旧页面，同时后台重新生成&#10;// 重新生成完成后: 后续请求返回新页面\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ISR (Incremental Static Regeneration) — Next.js 的 SWR 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/products/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> revalidate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 60 秒后标记为 stale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductsPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProducts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProductGrid</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 行为：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0-60s: 返回缓存的静态页面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 60s+: 返回缓存的旧页面，同时后台重新生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重新生成完成后: 后续请求返回新页面</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"个性化内容的缓存策略\">个性化内容的缓存策略</h2><p>个性化是 SSR 缓存的最大挑战：每个用户看到不同内容，缓存命中率趋近于零。解决方案是<strong>分离公共壳和个性化片段</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;可缓存(公共)&quot;&#10;        A[页面布局]&#10;        B[产品信息]&#10;        C[静态内容]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;不可缓存(个性化)&quot;&#10;        D[推荐列表]&#10;        E[购物车状态]&#10;        F[用户问候]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    G[PPR] --&gt; A&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; C&#10;    H[动态渲染] --&gt; D&#10;    H --&gt; E&#10;    H --&gt; F\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"可缓存(公共)\"\n        A[页面布局]\n        B[产品信息]\n        C[静态内容]\n    end\n    subgraph \"不可缓存(个性化)\"\n        D[推荐列表]\n        E[购物车状态]\n        F[用户问候]\n    end\n\n    G[PPR] --&gt; A\n    G --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; C\n    H[动态渲染] --&gt; D\n    H --&gt; E\n    H --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PPR（壳缓存 + 动态注入）</td>\n<td>页面大部分公共、少量个性化</td>\n<td>Suspense 边界分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vary 头</td>\n<td>少量分组（如地区、语言）</td>\n<td><code>Vary: Accept-Language, X-Country</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Edge 个性化</td>\n<td>基于 cookie/地理的简单变体</td>\n<td>Middleware 重写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端获取</td>\n<td>高度个性化的片段</td>\n<td>壳渲染后 SWR/React Query 补充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"缓存一致性与竞态\">缓存一致性与竞态</h2><p>分布式缓存环境下的一致性问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 问题场景：用户更新了产品，但不同 CDN 节点的缓存更新有延迟&#10;// 用户 A（上海节点）：看到新价格&#10;// 用户 B（东京节点）：仍看到旧价格（东京节点缓存未失效）&#10;&#10;// 解决方案 1：Purge-on-write&#10;export async function updateProduct(id: string, data: ProductData) {&#10;  &#39;use server&#39;;&#10;  await db.products.update({ where: { id }, data });&#10;&#10;  // 全球 CDN purge — 确保所有节点失效&#10;  await cdn.purge(`/products/${id}`);&#10;  revalidateTag(`product-${id}`);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 解决方案 2：版本化缓存键&#10;async function getProduct(id: string) {&#10;  &#39;use cache&#39;;&#10;  cacheTag(`product-${id}-v${await getProductVersion(id)}`);&#10;  return await db.products.findById(id);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 问题场景：用户更新了产品，但不同 CDN 节点的缓存更新有延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户 A（上海节点）：看到新价格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户 B（东京节点）：仍看到旧价格（东京节点缓存未失效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 解决方案 1：Purge-on-write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'use server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.products.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ where: { id }, data });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 全球 CDN purge — 确保所有节点失效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cdn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">purge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/products/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  revalidateTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`product-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 解决方案 2：版本化缓存键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'use cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cacheTag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`product-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-v${</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProductVersion</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.products.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"缓存策略选型矩阵\">缓存策略选型矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据特征</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>个性化</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>产品目录</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>ISR (revalidate: 3600)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格/库存</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>use cache</code> + cacheLife(&#39;minutes&#39;)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户仪表盘</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>完全个性化</td>\n<td>不缓存（dynamic）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新闻 Feed</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>部分（推荐）</td>\n<td>PPR: 壳缓存 + 推荐动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索结果</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>按查询</td>\n<td>Edge 缓存 + Vary: query</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户评论</td>\n<td>不频繁</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>use cache</code> + Tag 失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SSR 缓存要同时处理新鲜度、个性化、粒度、失效四个正交维度，本质是用空间换时间</li>\n<li>缓存分布在浏览器 / CDN / 应用级 / 数据层 / 数据库多层，每层命中率与失效特性不同</li>\n<li><code>use cache</code> 把粒度从路由下沉到组件/函数级，以函数参数为缓存键，缓存的是渲染输出</li>\n<li>标签式失效让 <code>revalidateTag</code> 只精确失效受影响的缓存，而非整站</li>\n<li>SWR（stale-while-revalidate）让用户在后台更新期间永远看到内容而非加载态</li>\n<li>个性化是最大挑战，解法是分离可缓存的公共壳与不可缓存的个性化片段</li>\n<li>分布式一致性靠 Purge-on-write 或版本化缓存键解决</li>\n<li>选型取决于数据的变化频率与个性化程度的交叉</li>\n</ul>\n<p>正确的缓存策略选择取决于数据的<strong>变化频率</strong>和<strong>个性化程度</strong>的交叉。本篇与前两篇（<a href=\"partial-prerendering\">PPR</a>、<a href=\"edge-rendering-strategies\">边缘渲染</a>）共同构成渲染优化的三个正交维度：什么时候做（构建 vs 请求）、在哪里做（Edge vs Origin）、做过的结果怎么存（缓存粒度与失效）。三者组合应用，才能在生产环境中实现最优的渲染性能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SSR 缓存模式","id":"ssr-缓存模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存层次模型","id":"缓存层次模型"},{"level":2,"text":"全页缓存：HTTP 缓存头","id":"全页缓存-http-缓存头"},{"level":2,"text":"组件级缓存：`use cache` 指令","id":"组件级缓存-use-cache-指令"},{"level":2,"text":"标签式失效（Tag-based Invalidation）","id":"标签式失效-tag-based-invalidation"},{"level":2,"text":"Stale-While-Revalidate 模式","id":"stale-while-revalidate-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化内容的缓存策略","id":"个性化内容的缓存策略"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存一致性与竞态","id":"缓存一致性与竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存策略选型矩阵","id":"缓存策略选型矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边缘渲染策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/optimization/edge-rendering-strategies"},"next":null}